{"job_id":"4975ecace36038c70nFy39q6GVtR","title":"Senior AI Agent Expert / Architect","company":"上海某大型互联网金融上市公司","location":"广州","salary":"30-50K","experience":"10年以上","education":"本科","url":"https://www.zhipin.com/job_detail/4975ecace36038c70nFy39q6GVtR.html","description":"Responsibilities\nAgent Architecture Design: Lead the top-level architecture design of production-grade Multi-Agent systems, ensuring high scalability, low latency, and robust system stability.\nComplex Workflow Orchestration: Deconstruct intricate financial business logic into autonomous agent workflows equipped with advanced planning, ReAct, and Plan-and-Solve capabilities.\nGoogle AI Ecosystem Optimization: Deeply integrate and fine-tune Google Gemini models via their SDKs, maximizing the utilization of native long-context windows, multimodal inputs, and context caching features.\nToolchain & API Integration: Seamlessly connect AI agents with enterprise financial databases, quantitative tools, and real-time market data APIs, optimizing Tool/Function Calling success rates.\nDeterminism & Guardrails: Implement financial-grade safety guardrails to ensure agents behave predictably, safely, and in full compliance with rigorous financial regulations.\nRequirements\nCore Experience: 5+ years of experience in AI/NLP or backend architecture, with at least 2 years of proven track record deploying complex LLM agents or workflow systems in a production environment.\nAgent Framework Proficiency: Deep expertise in mainstream agent orchestration and graph frameworks such as LangGraph, CrewAI, or AutoGen, with the ability to customize core components.\nGoogle Ecosystem Expertise:\noHighly proficient with Google Vertex AI SDK or Google GenAI SDK.\noHands-on engineering experience using Gemini's native features like Context Caching and advanced Function Calling to optimize token costs and inference latency.\nEngineering Excellence: Production-level mastery of Python, with strong skills in asynchronous programming (asyncio) and high-concurrency distributed system design.\nSupporting Tech: Strong familiarity with advanced RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) and vector databases to feed agents precise, domains-specific knowledge.\nEducation: Bachelor’s degree or higher (Master's preferred) in Computer Science, Data Science, Mathematics, Financial Engineering, or a related quantitative field.\nPreferred Qualifications\nPrior professional experience in FinTech, top-tier brokerages, investment banks, or quantitative hedge funds.\nHands-on experience with Google Vertex AI Agent Builder or enterprise safety components (e.g., Grounding with Google Search).\nExperience with LLM Fine-tuning to improve model accuracy for specific financial tools, domain vocabularies, or structured API outputs.\nStrong financial domain knowledge or professional credentials (e.g., CFA, FRM).","status":"已采集详情","collected_at":"2026-10-23","keywords":"Agent；RAG","first_keyword":"Agent","keyword_count":"2","is_guangzhou":"是","address":"页面未显示"}
